# Runtime state a vendored skill writes beside its own SKILL.md. `design-taste-frontend` creates
# .taste-skill/build.json when a worker arms its finish gate; that is per-build scratch, not part
# of the vendored copy, and committing it would make the pin in VENDORED.md describe something
# the upstream repository does not contain.
skills/**/.taste-skill/
skills/**/.taste-pro/

